      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"setback\" though. it's everything. my reputation, my house, my entire identity. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a failure. the idea of having to explain this to my family or my friends... of them looking at me with that pitying look... i can't stand the thought of living through that humiliation. it feels like the descent is already over and there's nothing left but the crash.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
